{"text":{"en":{"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Structural cross-section (conceptual)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"Link Ball Cross-Section Diagram\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (overall length)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (housing outer diameter)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">Thread</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Ball stud + socket housing structure · D (housing outer diameter) · L (overall length) · ball diameter · thread<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">This is a conceptual structural diagram whose proportions may differ from actual models; refer to the table below for dimensions.</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">Model No. Search</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. ZBL10 or M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"Thread","D(하우징 외경)":"D (Housing O.D.)","볼 지름":"Ball Diameter","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"Unit: mm (Weight in g)","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>Link Ball ZBL(RBL) Series</h2> <p>A spherical joint combining a ball stud with a socket-type seat, used at the connections of linkage mechanisms where linear and oscillating motion occur together. In the Korean market, ZBL (Zalman Precision/JMC) and RBL (Ilsung Tech/IBC) model numbers share identical specifications and are interchangeable.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of a model number or dimension.</p>","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ ZBL(RBL) specifications are listed as “ZBL(RBL)” on the rod end page of our SWS catalog and are identical to those in Korean distribution materials (Zalman Precision, etc.). “R/L” indicates the thread direction (right/left) and is added at the end of the model number. Some distribution materials list similar model numbers as products of other manufacturers (e.g. THK), so be sure to check the model number against the drawing before precision machining or ordering.","링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈 | [회사명] 베어링":"Link Ball ZBL(RBL) Series | [Company Name] Bearing","형번 검색":"Model No. Search"},"ja":{"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">構造断面図（概念図）</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"リンクボール断面図\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (全長)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (ハウジング外径)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">ねじ部</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ ボールスタッド + ソケットハウジング構造 · D(ハウジング外径)・L(全長)・ボール径・ねじ(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">実際の形番別の比率とは異なる場合がある構造概念図であり、寸法値は下の表に従います。</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">型番検索</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: ZBL10 または M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"ねじ(Thread)","D(하우징 외경)":"D(ハウジング外径)","볼 지름":"ボール径","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"単位: mm (質量はg)","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>リンクボール ZBL(RBL)シリーズ</h2> <p>ボールスタッドとソケット形シートが結合した球面ジョイントで、直線・揺動運動が同時に発生するリンク機構の連結部に使用されます。国内流通市場では ZBL（ザルマン精工/JMC）と RBL（イルソンテック/IBC）の2つの形番が同一規格で相互互換されます。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">形番または寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p>","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ ZBL(RBL)規格は当社SWSカタログのロッドエンドページに「ZBL(RBL)」として併せて収録されており、国内流通資料（ザルマン精密など）とも同一規格です。「R/L」はねじの方向（右・左）を表し、形番の末尾に別途表記されます。一部の流通資料では類似形番を他メーカー（例: THK）の製品として表記している場合があるため、精密加工・発注前には必ず形番と図面を照合して最終確認してください。","링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈 | [회사명] 베어링":"リンクボール ZBL(RBL)シリーズ | [会社名] ベアリング","형번 검색":"型番検索"},"zh":{"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"링크 볼 단면도\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (전장)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (하우징 외경)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">나사부</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 볼 스터드 + 소켓 하우징 구조 · D(하우징 외경)·L(전장)·볼 지름·나사(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">结构剖面图（示意图）</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 220\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 320px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"连杆球头剖面图\"> <path d=\"M110,30 h140 a30,30 0 0 1 30,30 v40 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 a45,45 0 0 1 -90,0 v-40 a30,30 0 0 1 10,-30 z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#333\"> <rect x=\"168\" y=\"142\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"30\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"150\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"30\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(-90 30 94)\">L (全长)</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"25\"><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\"> <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"20\" marker-start=\"url(#lbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#lbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"180\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D (外壳外径)</text> <text x=\"220\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">螺纹部</text> <defs> <marker id=\"lbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 球头螺柱 + 球座外壳结构 · D(外壳外径)・L(全长)・球径・螺纹(Thread)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">此为结构示意图，比例可能与实际型号不同，尺寸以下表为准。</span></p>","<label for=\"lbFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: ZBL10 또는 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"lbFilter\">型号搜索</label> <input id=\"lbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: ZBL10 或 M12\" autocomplete=\"off\">","나사(Thread)":"螺纹(Thread)","D(하우징 외경)":"D(壳体外径)","볼 지름":"球径","단위: mm (중량은 g)":"单位: mm (重量为g)","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈</h2> <p>볼 스터드와 소켓형 시트가 결합된 구면 조인트로, 직선·요동 운동이 함께 발생하는 링크 기구의 연결부에 사용됩니다. 국내 유통 시장에서는 ZBL(잘만정공/JMC)과 RBL(일성테크/IBC) 두 형번이 동일 규격으로 상호 호환됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Link Ball · ZBL(RBL)</p> <h2>连杆球头 ZBL(RBL)系列</h2> <p>由球头销与球座型座体结合而成的球面接头，用于同时存在直线运动和摆动运动的连杆机构连接部位。在韩国流通市场中，ZBL（扎尔曼精工/JMC）与 RBL（日成科技/IBC）两种型号规格相同，可相互替换。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">只需输入部分型号或尺寸即可搜索。</p>","※ ZBL(RBL) 규격은 당사 SWS 카탈로그의 로드 엔드 페이지에 “ZBL(RBL)”로 함께 수록되어 있으며, 국내 유통 자료(잘만정밀 등)와도 동일 규격입니다. “R/L”은 나사 방향(우·좌)을 나타내며 형번 끝에 별도 표기됩니다. 일부 유통 자료에서 유사 형번을 다른 제조사(예: THK) 제품으로 표기하는 경우가 있으니, 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 형번과 도면을 대조해 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.":"※ ZBL(RBL)规格以“ZBL(RBL)”一并收录于本公司SWS样本的杆端轴承页面，与韩国流通资料（扎尔曼精密等）规格相同。“R/L”表示螺纹方向（右・左），另行标注于型号末尾。部分流通资料会将类似型号标为其他制造商（例: THK）的产品，因此精密加工・下单前请务必核对型号与图纸进行最终确认。","링크 볼 ZBL(RBL) 시리즈 | [회사명] 베어링":"连杆球头 ZBL(RBL)系列 | [公司名] 轴承","형번 검색":"型号搜索"}},"attrs":{"en":{"링크 볼 단면도":"Link Ball Cross-Section Diagram","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"e.g. ZBL10 or M12"},"ja":{"링크 볼 단면도":"リンクボール断面図","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"例: ZBL10 または M12"},"zh":{"링크 볼 단면도":"连杆球头剖面图","예: ZBL10 또는 M12":"例: ZBL10 或 M12"}}}